\f0\fs36\b Along the coast\b0\par
\fs26\par
We left before sunrise and followed the old road north, with the sea on our left the whole way.\par
\par
The hills turn blue-green in the morning light. By noon the wind had dropped, and the bay was as flat as a mirror.\par
\par
Tomorrow: the walk out to the lighthouse, then lunch in the harbour if the weather holds.\par
}
